   "search_text": "4. A sequence b1, b2, b3,. . . of nonzero real numbers has the property that\n\n                                             b2  −1                                                 n+1\n                                      bn+2 =\n                                               bn\n\n   for all positive integers n.\n\n  Suppose that b1 = 1 and b2 = k where 1 < k < 2. Show that there is some constant B,\n   depending on k, such that −B ≤bn ≤B for all n. Also show that, for some 1 < k < 2, there\n    is a value of n such that bn > 2020.\n",
